#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD0004 expect=skipped domain=APDM
#note "THE SPLIT-BOUNDARY PIN. This dataset is conformant and would be silent anyway - the fixture is about WHICH RULE OWNS IT. The name APDM matches the Exclude entry 'AP--' (four characters, prefix AP), so PMDA-SD0004 does not execute (SKIPPED: domain APDM matches Scope.Domains.Exclude entry AP--); PMDA-SD0004-A owns it instead, whose own valid_ap_code_matches-APDM fixture uses the identical dataset."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset APDM
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN  type=Char
col APID    type=Char
col RSUBJID type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | APDM | AP-001 | 01-701-1015
